  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Propagating Agro-aqua green enterprises and community food circles for sustainable and climate resilient local communities in Negros Occidental, Leyte, and Dinagat Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Local communities of actors in the food system (e.g., farmers, fishers, women, youth, sellers, processors, CSOs, LGUs, etc.) in Negros Occidental, Leyte, and Dinagat Islands provinces enhance their climate resilience, disaster risk reduction, and improve livelihoods by forming &#xbf;Food Circles&#xbf; that reduce food loss and waste and promote sustainable and regenerative practices in food production and consumption.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
